        "paragraphCount": 7,
        "openingParagraph": "BOSTON, Oct. 14, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Rapid7, Inc. (NASDAQ: RPD), a global leader in AI-powered managed cybersecurity operations, today announced that the company will release its third quarter 2026 financial results on Wednesday, November 4, 2026, after the financial markets close.",
